{"ts": "2026-05-26T02:12:49.882Z", "source": "system", "kind": "utterance", "text": "Hei, olen Hieronta Maatti. Millä nimellä kutsumme teidät hierontaan?", "call_sid": "CA91891aecee1c5ff2c784edd80a9a2ac5", "stream_sid": "MZc709d514f3f462d6163f6b0c96363736", "speaking": true, "listening": false}
{"ts": "2026-05-26T02:13:07.188Z", "source": "user", "kind": "utterance", "text": "Nimeni on testihenkilö ja edustan organisaatiota testi OY.", "call_sid": "CA91891aecee1c5ff2c784edd80a9a2ac5", "stream_sid": "MZc709d514f3f462d6163f6b0c96363736", "speaking": false, "listening": false}
{"ts": "2026-05-26T02:13:08.479Z", "source": "system", "kind": "utterance", "text": "Kiitos. Kirjaan tietoja.", "call_sid": "CA91891aecee1c5ff2c784edd80a9a2ac5", "stream_sid": "MZc709d514f3f462d6163f6b0c96363736", "speaking": true, "listening": false}
{"ts": "2026-05-26T02:13:12.220Z", "source": "system", "kind": "utterance", "text": "Mikä on teille jäänyt mukavimpana muistona näiltä tai aiemmilta ATK-päiviltä?", "call_sid": "CA91891aecee1c5ff2c784edd80a9a2ac5", "stream_sid": "MZc709d514f3f462d6163f6b0c96363736", "speaking": true, "listening": false}
{"ts": "2026-05-26T02:13:21.641Z", "source": "user", "kind": "utterance", "text": "Muistan kun ensimmäinen tietokone tuli toimistoon.", "call_sid": "CA91891aecee1c5ff2c784edd80a9a2ac5", "stream_sid": "MZc709d514f3f462d6163f6b0c96363736", "speaking": false, "listening": false}
{"ts": "2026-05-26T02:13:22.929Z", "source": "system", "kind": "utterance", "text": "Kiitos. Kirjaan tietoja.", "call_sid": "CA91891aecee1c5ff2c784edd80a9a2ac5", "stream_sid": "MZc709d514f3f462d6163f6b0c96363736", "speaking": true, "listening": false}
{"ts": "2026-05-26T02:13:26.696Z", "source": "system", "kind": "utterance", "text": "Eli kutsuisimme teitä nimellä testihenkilö, organisaatiosta testi OY, ja muistonne ATK-päiviltä on: “Muistan kun ensimmäinen tietokone tuli toimistoon.” Onko tämä oikein?", "call_sid": "CA91891aecee1c5ff2c784edd80a9a2ac5", "stream_sid": "MZc709d514f3f462d6163f6b0c96363736", "speaking": true, "listening": false}
{"ts": "2026-05-26T02:13:55.087Z", "source": "system", "kind": "utterance", "text": "En valitettavasti kuule sinua.", "call_sid": "CA91891aecee1c5ff2c784edd80a9a2ac5", "stream_sid": "MZc709d514f3f462d6163f6b0c96363736", "speaking": true, "listening": false}
{"ts": "2026-05-26T02:14:06.635Z", "source": "user", "kind": "utterance", "text": "Kyllä yhteenveto on oikein.", "call_sid": "CA91891aecee1c5ff2c784edd80a9a2ac5", "stream_sid": "MZc709d514f3f462d6163f6b0c96363736", "speaking": false, "listening": false}
{"ts": "2026-05-26T02:14:07.918Z", "source": "system", "kind": "utterance", "text": "Kiitos. Kirjaan tietoja.", "call_sid": "CA91891aecee1c5ff2c784edd80a9a2ac5", "stream_sid": "MZc709d514f3f462d6163f6b0c96363736", "speaking": true, "listening": false}
{"ts": "2026-05-26T02:14:10.267Z", "source": "system", "kind": "utterance", "text": "Kiitoksia. Kutsumme teidät mahdollisimman pian. Kuulemiin.", "call_sid": "CA91891aecee1c5ff2c784edd80a9a2ac5", "stream_sid": "MZc709d514f3f462d6163f6b0c96363736", "speaking": true, "listening": false}
